rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a326435f6df49e36250369a413caabee", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2a4bae4d/uploads/origins/6d5e110e-6299-4256-bb85-5b369006944c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a326435f6df49e36250369a413caabee, https://si.imgix.net/2a4bae4d/uploads/origins/6d5e110e-6299-4256-bb85-5b369006944c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5f5f1cd65ac27d0e1a2a52fcba743b77 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a4bae4d/uploads/origins/6d5e110e-6299-4256-bb85-5b369006944c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b6dc810fc107d469777a5595e9e8fab 3x"}, "body": "Hello ! I love your cute and soft art style !\n\nI would like to request for you to draw the cover art of my Alioth vtuber for the song マーシャル・マキシマイザー by  Hiiragii Magnetite : https://youtu.be/jMKPYg0uhCI\n\nPlease draw this in 16:9 ratio and separate the character from the background in the PSD! The character is a boy but cute like a girl , so please keep his chest flat. Please give the drawing a feeling that matches the vibe of a song with a background as well ! Please also give the character two different facial expressions if possible. \n\nIf accepted, I will be using this piece on Twitter/Twitch/Youtube with credits to you!\n\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EJIX7JRm0sX4_7pNxUE0hRLuO7vqXSov?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EJIX7JRm0sX4_7pNxUE0hRLuO7vqXSov?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@niko_msa/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2332522, "client_id": 602321, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/624a1cc0/uploads/origins/6ba8cb27-8766-46e1-9f26-1a1de2adcaae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h